From: Shammah Chancellor <shammah.chancellor@notvalid.com>
Date: Tue, 20 Oct 2026 15:38:54 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] logging: preserve padded block filenames in typed reindex
 progress

Expose the original unsigned-int file number as a numeric field while the
consumer retains blk%05u.dat text. Keep Info level, the original cast, file
open/read operations, ordering and interrupt handling. A focused functional
control reindexes its own genesis block, waits for completion, verifies the
unchanged genesis/height and checks the actual file-number event after stop.
Runtime validation is pending; no data or reindex behavior changes.

Scripted diff (ast-grep-py0.51.0; explicit single-site catalog):
/private/tmp/lane-n4-build/logging-compose/ast-venv/bin/python contrib/logging/conversion/convert.py --root . --rules contrib/logging/conversion/rules/block-file-reindex-progress.json --report /Users/shammah/repos/lotus-v2-repair-work/logging-cleanup/block-reindex341-conversion.json --apply
git clang-format --force --binary /opt/homebrew/bin/clang-format --style '{BasedOnStyle: InheritParentConfig, BreakStringLiterals: false}' HEAD -- src/node/blockstorage.cpp

diff --git a/contrib/logging/conversion/rules/block-file-reindex-progress.json b/contrib/logging/conversion/rules/block-file-reindex-progress.json
new file mode 100644
index 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000..df4819338afb76ec6a2fed5b7f5bb9bba253bf61
--- /dev/null
+++ b/contrib/logging/conversion/rules/block-file-reindex-progress.json
@@ -0,0 +1,30 @@
+{
+  "schema": 1,
+  "batch": "block-file-reindex-progress",
+  "status": "SOURCE_APPLIED_PENDING_NATIVE_GATE",
+  "requires": "bounded decimal consumer rendering",
+  "files": [
+    {
+      "path": "src/node/blockstorage.cpp",
+      "rules": [
+        {
+          "id": "block_file_reindexing",
+          "old": "LogPrintf(\"Reindexing block file blk%05u.dat...\\n\",\n                          (unsigned int)nFile)",
+          "replacement": "LogInfoEvent(BCLog::ALL, \"block_file_reindexing\", \"Reindexing block file blk{file_number:05u}.dat...\").Field(BCLog::LogField::FileNumber, (unsigned int)nFile)",
+          "count": 1,
+          "reviewed_input": {
+            "macro": "LogPrintf",
+            "format": "Reindexing block file blk%05u.dat...\n",
+            "specifiers": [
+              "%05u"
+            ],
+            "arguments": [
+              "(unsigned int)nFile"
+            ]
+          },
+          "review_note": "Preserve Info, exact zero-padded filename and original explicit unsigned-int cast; no block-file open/read/reindex or interruption behavior changes. The cast value fits the existing signed64 FileNumber field without narrowing. Actual full reindex and numeric/text checks remain pending."
+        }
+      ]
+    }
+  ]
+}
